# This repository ships code and documentation only; raw data, intermediate
# products and results stay local. The pattern is ignore-everything-then-allow
# source, so any new result file type (rasters, matrices, caches, reports) is
# excluded by default.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.md
!*.py
!*.R
!*.sh
!**/requirements.txt
!**/install.log

# ============================================================
# The block below comes last and overrides the source allow-list above.
# Git uses the LAST matching rule, so these must exclude whole directories.
# ============================================================

# Third-party R package library: a macOS arm64 build containing many other
# people's .R/.sh files. Reinstall it on another machine.
03_r_env/R_libs/
# Chapter 07's Python virtual environment: same reasoning, contains a large
# number of .py files under site-packages.
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/

# PLINK scratch directory written at run time (holds relieff_bestk.R for Relief-F)
05_results/_tmp
05_results/_tmp.*

# 06_references is entirely other people's work: reference PDFs, Chinese
# full-text translations, a scraped news archive, plus third-party scripts
# under 参考文献代码
06_references/
# A third-party thesis at the package root
external_thesis.docx

# ============================================================
# Report builders whose text names the study species. They stay local;
# the .docx reports they produce are not redistributed either.
# ============================================================
04_population_assignment/build_design.py
04_population_assignment/build_paper.py
04_population_assignment/build_report.py
08_genetic_offset/05_env/build_offset_report.py
